---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="MoA — Mixture of Agents | Paradigm IT Services" description="Not one AI model — three. Each with different strengths. On every hard question, Ha runs multiple models in parallel and synthesises their best reasoning.">
  <Header logoVariant="mono-white" />
  <main id="main">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary py-20 lg:py-28 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="inline-block border-2 border-secondary-fixed-dim p-3 mb-4"><span class="font-serif text-4xl text-secondary-fixed-dim">Mo</span></div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-white leading-[1.05] mt-4 max-w-4xl">Mixture of Agents. <span class="italic text-secondary-fixed-dim">Many Minds, One Answer.</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-white/70 font-body leading-relaxed text-lg">Single models have blind spots. MoA runs three models in parallel on every hard question — each with different training, different strengths, different failure modes — then synthesises their best reasoning into one final answer.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-on-primary font-sans text-sm px-6 py-3 mt-8 hover:bg-secondary transition-colors tracking-wide group">Deploy Ha with MoA <svg class="h-4 w-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Problem -->
    <section class="bg-surface py-20 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
          <div>
            <span class="font-body text-xs text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.4em] block">The Problem</span>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-on-surface mt-4 leading-[1.1]">Every Model Has <span class="italic text-primary">Blind Spots.</span></h2>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant mt-6 leading-relaxed">DeepSeek is strong at reasoning but weak at creative writing. MiniMax handles long context well but can miss nuance. Big Pickle is fast but shallow. Pick any single model and you're betting everything on its strengths — while accepting its weaknesses.</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant mt-4 leading-relaxed">MoA doesn't pick one. It runs them all, lets each contribute what it's best at, and uses an aggregator model to synthesise their combined analysis into a single, superior answer.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-serif text-[10rem] text-on-surface/10">Mo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it works -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <span class="font-body text-xs text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.4em] block">The Architecture</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-on-surface mt-4 leading-[1.1]">Parallel Advisors, <span class="italic text-primary">Single Aggregator.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-surface p-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><span class="font-sans text-xs text-primary font-bold uppercase">Ref 1</span></div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm text-on-surface font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase">Reasoning Advisor</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">MiniMax M2.5-Free — strong reasoning, long context (256K tokens). Excels at complex logic, architecture decisions, and multi-step analysis.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface p-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><span class="font-sans text-xs text-primary font-bold uppercase">Ref 2</span></div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm text-on-surface font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase">Speed Advisor</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">Big Pickle — fast, reliable generalist. Good for everyday coding tasks, file edits, and quick analysis that the reasoning model can then verify.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface p-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><span class="font-sans text-xs text-primary font-bold uppercase">Ag</span></div>
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm text-on-surface font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase">Aggregator</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">DeepSeek V4 Flash-Free — synthesises both advisors' analysis into a coherent final answer. Rates each advisor's contribution, resolves contradictions, adds its own judgement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Benckmark -->
    <section class="bg-surface py-20 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-on-surface leading-[1.1]">Benchmarked. <span class="italic text-primary">+6 Points Over the Best Single Model.</span></h2>
          <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant mt-6 leading-relaxed">On HermesBench, a two-model MoA preset (Opus 4.8 aggregator + GPT-5.5 reference) scored 0.8202 — beating Opus 4.8 alone (0.7607) by 6 points. The improvement doesn't come from averaging. It comes from each model catching what the other missed.</p>
          <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant mt-4 leading-relaxed">Ha ships with three free models pre-configured as a MoA preset. You don't need to configure anything. Every hard question gets the multi-model treatment automatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Models table -->
    <section class="bg-surface-container py-20">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="bg-surface overflow-hidden">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-0 text-sm">
            <div class="p-4 bg-primary/5 font-sans text-xs text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Role</div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-primary/5 font-sans text-xs text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Model</div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-primary/5 font-sans text-xs text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Provider</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">Aggregator</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">deepseek-v4-flash-free</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">OpenCode Zen</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">Advisor 1</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">minimax-m2.5-free</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">OpenCode Zen</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">Advisor 2</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">big-pickle</div>
            <div class="p-4 font-body text-on-surface border-t border-surface-container">OpenCode Zen</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-4 text-center">All three models are free tier. Zero ongoing model licensing costs.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary py-20 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-white leading-[1.1]">Multiple Minds. One Decision.</h2>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-sans text-sm px-8 py-4 mt-8 hover:bg-white hover:text-on-surface transition-colors tracking-wide group">Deploy Ha with MoA <svg class="h-4 w-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
